<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-1510] Dictionary filter skips null values when evaluating not-equals.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-1510</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This was discovered in Spark, see &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/SPARK-26677&quot; title=&quot;Incorrect results of not(eqNullSafe) when data read from Parquet file &quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;SPARK-26677&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;SPARK-26677&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. From the Spark PR:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;// Repeat the values to get dictionary encoding.
&lt;/span&gt;Seq(Some(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;A&quot;&lt;/span&gt;), Some(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;A&quot;&lt;/span&gt;), None).toDF.repartition(1).write.mode(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;overwrite&quot;&lt;/span&gt;).parquet(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/tmp/foo&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
spark.read.parquet(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/tmp/foo&quot;&lt;/span&gt;).where(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;NOT (value &amp;lt;=&amp;gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;A&apos;&lt;/span&gt;)&quot;&lt;/span&gt;).show()
+-----+
|value|
+-----+
+-----+
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;// Use plain encoding.
&lt;/span&gt;Seq(Some(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;A&quot;&lt;/span&gt;), None).toDF.repartition(1).write.mode(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;overwrite&quot;&lt;/span&gt;).parquet(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/tmp/bar&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
spark.read.parquet(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/tmp/bar&quot;&lt;/span&gt;).where(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;NOT (value &amp;lt;=&amp;gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;A&apos;&lt;/span&gt;)&quot;&lt;/span&gt;).show()
+-----+
|value|
+-----+
| &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;|
+-----+
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is a correctness issue.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
